== Short Bio
Hello. I'm Monsij Biswal, a final year undergraduate at National Institute of Technology Durgapur pursuing my B. Tech
in Electronics and Communication Engineering.

 My broad area of interest is Wireless Communication, Millimeter Waves and Signal Processing. Recently
 , I have been investigating the application of neural networks in these domains.

 I am familiar with programming in Python, C, C\+\+, MATLAB. I implemented a custom training function for neural network
 during my internship with [https://www.nt.tf.uni-kiel.de/en/staff/prof.-dr.-ing.-dipl.-wirt.-ing.stephan-pachnicke Prof. Stephan Pachnicke] at Germany.

 Besides work, I am a aviation enthusiast and an avid shutterbug.



